            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.1+DEU.28.2+DEU.28.3+DEU.28.4+DEU.28.5+DEU.28.6+DEU.28.7+DEU.28.8+DEU.28.9+DEU.28.10+DEU.28.11+DEU.28.12+DEU.28.13+DEU.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ka wiluwo cik paran to wikuro or paran to wimako jo gi genirok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alamiyo win koth mewin i hongo ma ripo, to piny nyak cemo mere, to yen ma ndelin nyak olemo mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piedhirok mewin laloyo vini ma winofon, aka vini ma winofon, laloyo gima winokec; wilacemo to wiyeŋ, to wibedo gi siem i piny mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka alamiyo piny siem, wilanindo, aka ongoye ŋat'obwoki win; alakwanyo woko ogwaŋe ma kelo teko i piny, aka lweny moro k'obedi i piny mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilariemo jokwor mewin, aka jolagore piny ruwaŋ win ka wineko jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abic kwoŋ win jolariemo miya cel, aka ji miya cel kwoŋ win jolariemo jokwor gana apar; jokwor mewin jolagore piny ruwaŋ win ka wineko jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaneno win gi wor t'amiyo winywol to wibedo m'omore; t'akuro cikirok paran kodi win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilacamo cemo ma cango okan con, wicam wicow woko macon to wiyawo hola ri manyen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaketho kabedo paran i dier win, aka ak'ojwangi win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alawoth i dier win, alabedo Were mewin, aka wilabedo ji paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An abedo Rwoth Were mewin m'ofudho win woko i piny ma Misir, ni wikiri wibedi ŋecin pajo kendo; atieko turo woko meni m'oyido diyo win piny aka onyo alamiyo wiwoth gi delok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.26.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
